---
description: How work happens in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---
Read README.md and CLAUDE.md before anything else. Then follow WORKFLOW.md.
Never push to main. Feature branches only, cut from main.
Never edit an applied migration. New schema = new timestamped file in supabase/migrations with grants and RLS in the same file.
Never put a key in code, chat, or .env.example. VITE_ prefix only on the Supabase URL and anon key.
Before commit: npx tsc -b --noEmit, npm run lint, npm test, npm run build, grep dist/assets for service_role.
No em dashes in code comments, commit messages, or UI copy.
Never invent a figure. Every number on screen comes from a row.
